  "rust_authorities": "Rust now owns public PCR history username/UUID/query/cursor validation, parameterized read SQL, keyset pagination and public field/detail projection. The actual Python broad-profile projection control is red before the port and excluded afterwards. Complete360-row weapon banks use128-row SQL pages;304-byte variants, legacy/summary/accuracy coverage, guest exclusion and opaque public aliases remain distinct. The introduced mutating registry-clock observation was caught and corrected; valid/malformed reads do not write and preserve an outer transaction. Shared cached career/profile totals and customization, population/presence, generic HTTP/provider/clock/SQLite IO, full Rust service replacement, original history/epoch recovery and native played/delivered gates remain open.",
  "reproduced_gap": {
    "trigger": "Replace the internal broad Python profile projection, then request the actual public player history/profile routes.",
    "before": "The previous matches response copies the injected private_identity and forged current-name/statistics fields.",
    "after": "Rust owns selected public fields and canonical current-profile/name SQL; the injected broad projection is not consulted.",
    "boundary": "Internal adapter-authority control, not a remote unauthenticated exploit claim."
  },
  "checks": [
    "Exact normalized current-username lookup, opaque UUID resolution and no unknown-account enrollment",
    "Duplicate/unknown query rejection, strict bounded cursor types and stable descending completion/public-ID keyset pagination",
    "Public field whitelist, current versus archived names,304-byte selected variants and guest/private identity exclusion",
    "Legacy/verified-summary/verified-accuracy/detail coverage remains explicit; no invented medal/weapon/opponent data",
    "Complete persisted360-row weapon bank through three128-row SQL pages without truncation, typed BLOB cells and source-index bounds",
    "Real synchronous valid/malformed read boundary performs no writes and preserves an existing uncommitted transaction",
    "Existing profile cache invalidation/expiry, accepted result idempotency/rollback and aggregate accuracy coverage regressions",
    "Frozen full backend and production ABI checks; offline Rust static/CXX/FFI/helper build"
  ],
